    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n40963" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπισταθμ-εύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>to be billeted</i> or <i>quartered upon</i>
			another, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Sull.</u>
				25
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Demetr.</u>
					23
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				2.828f
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. 
				Pass.
			, <i>to have</i> others <i>quartered upon one,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PPetr.
				2p.36
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>UPZ</u>
				146 ii 27
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				21.6.1
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>. <i>to be
				assigned as quarters</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰκία</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>. trans.,
				<i>occupy with</i>, in metaph. sense, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ὦτα διαλέξεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.778b
				</span></i>
			.</div>
